### Suggested Enhancements:  
- Prioritize the implementation of user authentication features (registration and login), which should include error handling and user feedback.  
- Enhance clarity concerning form submissions to specify how invalid inputs will be addressed and what feedback users should receive in various scenarios, both positive and negative.  
